        "text": "# Transparency Cue\n\nA **transparency cue** is information your app shows that helps users understand what’s happening with the data and trust the results. \n\n**Example:** Transparency cues explain counts, filters, and empty states, such as \"Showing 5 of 18 results\" and \"Filter: open now, price $$ or less.\"",
